# HD209458b -- solar metallicity (Asplund+2009 number ratios n_X/n_H), summed
# over ionization stages; the equilibrium solver distributes over ion stages.
# With He_metal_diffusion: True each element settles independently (heavier
# elements fractionate more strongly), on top of the He/H separation.
C     2.69e-4
N     6.76e-5
O     4.90e-4
Mg    3.98e-5
Ca    2.19e-6
Na    1.74e-6
Fe    3.16e-5
pp_metals 1
